# ed25519 license signing key material (issue #94) — private keys are NEVER
# committed; operators mint keypairs OUT OF REPO with `wanyrix license keygen`
# and point WANYRIX_SIGNING_KEY at the private half.
wanyrix-license-priv.hex
wanyrix-license-pub.hex
*-priv.hex

# Local-only working artifact: master validation prompt (never published)
/pending-task.md
.wanyrix/
dev.pid
